**Fix:** `src/lib.rs:18` — even-length median now averages the two middle elements: `(v[n / 2 - 1] + v[n / 2]) / 2` (was `v[n / 2] + v[n / 2 + 1]`, off-by-one, and would panic at the end of the vector).

